1) vnw_/vn/alu at n=1024 on an H=2048 residual: no exception.
   RMSNorm's denominator is a mean over the words it is TOLD about, so how
   badly the leading half is corrupted depends on how the residual's energy
   is split between the halves.  Two samples, because the first revision of
   this probe reported only the flat one and understated the damage
   (correction, 2026-08-25 — see CORRECTIONS.md):
