     x8[:1024] vs the n=H answer: max|diff| 1, mean|diff| 0.1, 120/1024 words changed (11.7 %)
     x8[1024:] left at 0 (the second half is never written)
   (b) uneven halves (hi 6x lo, the realistic case):
     half-energy  lo 52,467   hi 1,833,036
     DYNQ8 exponent   n=H -> 1   n=1024 -> 0   (SHIFTED)
     x8[:1024] vs the n=H answer: max|diff| 99, mean|diff| 48.6, 1020/1024 words changed (99.6 %)
     x8[1024:] left at 0 (the second half is never written)

